<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="about-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="about-intro-heading">Wild plans,<br class="mobile-br"> grounded hearts</h2>
    <p class="about-intro-body">We are a family built around travel, photography, creativity, and impact. Sometimes it is overlanding. Sometimes it is flying across the world. But it is always real life, told with intention.</p>
    <p class="about-intro-body">At home, a single conversation can move through four languages in a matter of minutes. That is not a marketing line: it is simply our way of being in the world.</p>
    <p class="about-intro-body">And what we started creating on the road found a life beyond the journey and beyond Instagram. Today, it also lives in the work we do for institutions, NGOs, and, through Reality Telling, our social impact company, in hospital rooms, where an immersive 360 video experience can take someone to a place they cannot physically reach.</p>
    <a href="/work-with-us/" class="btn btn-dark">Work with Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

